comment8.text=\r\n\ Decide\ en\ qu\u00E9\ s\u00EDmbolo\ queda\ la\ rueda\ al\ girar.\r\n\ @param\ proposed\ el\ s\u00EDmbolo\ en\ el\ que\ quedar\u00EDa\ una\ rueda\ normal\r\n\ @return\ el\ s\u00EDmbolo\ en\ el\ que\ realmente\ queda\r\n
